---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Main from "../../../layouts/article.astro";

const guideCollection = (await getCollection("guide")).filter(
  (entry) => !entry.data.draft,
);

const museumCollection = (await getCollection("museums")).filter(
  (museum) => new Date(museum.data.endDate) >= new Date(),
);

---

<Main
  showLanguageSwitcher={false}
  title="Guided through Paris"
  description="A place to share all things Paris from gettting around the city to tips on enjoying the tourist attractions."
>
  <style>
    .cards {
      list-style-type: none;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1em;
    }
    .cards li {
      border: 0.1em solid currentColor;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cards li.unknown {
      color: gray;
    }

    .cards li * {
      padding: 0.5em;
      display: block;
    }

    .cards li a {
      display: block;
      height: 100%;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    .cards li a:hover {
      background-color: var(--contrast);
    }

    .cards li h3 {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
  <h2>Guided through Paris</h2>
  <p>
    Hi, I'm Abi and I'm a tour guide who's been living in Paris since 2016! I
    love getting to show people the magic of the city, through telling stories,
    answering questions and helping you get around. I really believe that Paris
    has something for everyone.
  </p>
  <p>
    I love it living here! There's always so many possibilites on how to spend a
    day in Paris, from museums, places to eat and the different events. Every
    day, I find new things in the city to inspire me.
  </p>
  <p>
    Since living here, I've gave many tours of the city, and getting to take
    people around always reminds me of how much I love the city.
  </p>
  <p>
    Here you can find some of tips and tricks to visiting Paris, from places to
    visit and things to watch out for (like scams)
  </p>
  <p>
    I often share things on Instagram, <a
      href="https://www.instagram.com/abiguides/">@abiguides</a
    >, about things to do in Paris like upcoming events.
  </p>

  <p>I've broken down the articles into different themes:</p>

  <li>
    <a href="#personalised-tours">Personalised tours</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#faq">FAQ: tips and tricks</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#arrondissement-guide">A guide to the arrondissements</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#tourtist-attractions">Tourist attractions</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#activities">Activities in Paris</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#french-food">French food</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#myths-and-ledgends">Myths and ledgends</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
  </li>
  {
    museumCollection.length ? (
      <li>
        <a href="#museums">Current exhibitions</a>
      </li>
    ) : (
      ""
    )
  }
  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="personalised-tours">Personalised tours</h3>

    <p>
      Here you can read a bit about the types of tours that I offer. Paris has
      something for everyone, and I would love to be able to make your trip
      special!
    </p>

    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("tour"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>

    <p style="text-align: center">
      <a class="cta" href="/book/"> Book a tour</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <br />
  <div>
    <h3 id="faq">FAQ: tips and tricks for getting to know the city</h3>
    <p>
      Here you can find my tips and tricks! The essential things to know on your
      first visit to Paris like scams to watch out for, picking restaurants and
      getting around using public transport (public transport is something I am
      passionate about)
    </p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("how-to"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <br />
  <div>
    <h3 id="arrondissement-guide">A guide to the Paris arrondissements</h3>
    <p>
      Each arrondissement of Paris has something unique to offer. There are
      countless restaurants, bakeries, museums and places to shop. Here I'll
      talk about some of my favourite places based on the area.
    </p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("arrondissement"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="tourist-attractions">Tourist attractions</h3>
    <p>Tips and tricks for enjoying the tourist attractions around the city!</p>
    <p>
      There can be a lot of negative connotations around the toursty places,
      espeically in big cities like Paris. But usually places are popular for a
      reason! Here you can find my advice on making the most out of these
      places.
    </p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) =>
            article.data.themes.includes("tourist-attraction"),
          )
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="women-in-french-history">Women from French history</h3>
    <p>
      Women have played an important part throughout history, both within in
      France and around the world. Here you can learn more about some of the
      influential women in French history.
    </p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("women"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
  <!-- <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="itinerary">Itinerary</h3>
    <p>A guide on how best to spend your time in Paris</p>
    <p>
      Here's what I'd recommend to do based on how long you're in Paris for and
      the main type of things you'd like to see!
    </p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("itinerary"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div> -->
  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="activities">Activities in Paris</h3>
    <p>Here you can find some of my favourite things to do in Paris!</p>
    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("activity"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <br />
  <div>
    <h3 id="french-food">French food</h3>

    <p>
      France is known for their food, it's something they take seriously! Here
      you can find an overview on some of the important parts of French food.
    </p>

    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("food"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="myths-and-ledgends">Stories from the city</h3>

    <p>
      Some of the myths and ledgends of the city! Paris has so much history in <i
        >almost</i
      > plain sight if you know what to look for.
    </p>

    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("stories"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div>

  <br />

  <div>
    <h3 id="architecture">Architecture</h3>

    <p>
      Some of the things to look out for while walking around the city
    </p>

    <ul class="cards">
      {
        guideCollection
          .filter((article) => article.data.themes.includes("architecture"))
          .map((article) => {
            if (article) {
              return (
                <li value={article.data.title}>
                  <a href={`/articles/guide/${article.slug}/`}>
                    <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                    <p>{article.data.description}</p>
                  </a>
                </li>
              );
            }
          })
      }
    </ul>
  </div> 

  <br>


  {
    museumCollection.length ? (
      <>
        <div>
          <h3 id="museums">Current exhibitions</h3>
          <p>
            I love that Paris has so much to do an offer, even after eight years
            here, there's still always more to see
          </p>
          <p>Here are some current exhibitions that I've been to recently</p>
          <p>
            you can find passed exhibitions{" "}
            <a href="/articles/museums/">here</a>
          </p>

          <ul class="cards">
            {museumCollection.map((article) => {
              if (article) {
                return (
                  <li value={article.data.title}>
                    <a href={`/articles/museums/${article.slug}/`}>
                      <h3>{article.data.title}</h3>
                      <p>{article.data.intro}</p>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                );
              }
            })}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <br />
      </>
    ) : (
      ""
    )
  }
  <hr />

  <p>
    If you found any of these articles useful and would like to leave a small
    tip, you can <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/abisummers"
      >buy me a coffee</a
    >!
  </p>
  <footer>
    <ul class="no-bullets">
      <li>
        <a href="mailto:contact@abisummers.com">contact@abisummers.com</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/abiguides">@abiguides</a>
      </li>
      <li>SIREN: 843306648</li>
      <li>
        <a href="/articles/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </footer>
</Main>
